# Local Worker secrets. Prefer .dev.vars (see .dev.vars.example).
# Do not commit .env or .dev.vars. Do not put this key in config.js or index.html.
#
# Production:
#   npx wrangler secret put GOOGLE_VISION_API_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put OCR_ALLOWED_ORIGINS
#
# OCR_ALLOWED_ORIGINS is a comma-separated origin list. The deployed default
# is https://roubizhao6-sys.github.io (wrangler.jsonc). Set the secret only
# when you need to override that list. Example:
#   https://roubizhao6-sys.github.io,http://localhost:8080
GOOGLE_VISION_API_KEY=replace-with-server-side-api-key
